<SCENARIO VER="105">
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島パソコン.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Shiyo 788―exactly 12 years ago today, a hanami visitor died in an accident in Central Park.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Fell from a cherry tree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Got drunk and went tree climbing or something, maybe?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one who died was...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Motoki-cho resident <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="えいいちろう">Eiichiro</STYLE> Niimura-san (30)
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "BGM" "CLICK"}
<PG>
Niimura...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Niimura, as in...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\古郡茜紙人形.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\古郡良治紙人形.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\古郡なつみ紙人形.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Paper dolls...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> cursed someone to death like this 10 years ago, then."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"When I saw these in the morning, I was really scared. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">While I was asleep, I did it without knowing, I'm sure..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\古郡家居間死体.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム3,アイテム2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Is hell a sight like this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Blood had spread across the floor, and a great amount of blood had splattered on the walls too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And.<PG>
Lying collapsed, a great amount of blood flowing from her head, <STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her abdomen pierced by countless knives, <STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai's mother</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only her head lying off somewhere apart from her body, <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "avemaria.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\証明.gal" "NORMAL" "20" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'re still warm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If I'd gotten here a little sooner, would I have been able to save you...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Up to now, it was only ever people I hated who died. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But, this time </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">and even </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Why...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> didn't even have a paper doll..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花メッタざし.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花ナイフ抜く.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I like </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">so surely, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'ll die today too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... stop! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're wrong! This isn't a curse!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　It's murder! So..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, enough. </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> are both dead. Now, none of it matters... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">No... but </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'re still alive... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> are still alive..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Goodbye, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, at least, survive..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\春花自殺.lcm" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "人物1" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The girl who witnessed the end of it all, <STYLE ID="2">Erina Goto</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She</STYLE> despaired at her own powerlessness and at having lost the people dear to her, and never again showed herself as the genius girl she had once been.<PG>
And then, many years went by―
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "3000"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
